			"link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46635345",
			"contents": "<div class=\"Story_container\"><div class=\"Story_data\"><div class=\"Story_title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46635345\"><span>Ask HN: How can we solve the loneliness epidemic?</span></a></div><div class=\"Story_meta\"><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46635345\">784 points</a></span><span class=\"Story_separator\">|</span><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=publicdebates\"><span>publicdebates</span></a></span><span class=\"Story_separator\">|</span><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46635345\">4 days ago</a></span><span class=\"Story_separator\">|</span><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46635345\">1219 comments</a></span><div class=\"Story_comment\"><span>Countless voiceless people sit alone every day and have no one to talk to, people of all ages, who don't feel that they can join any local groups. So they sit on social media all day when they're not at work or school. How can we solve this?</span></div></div></div></div>",
